151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 104 0 R
/T (To solve this, the "CourseCraft AI" system collects free content and organizes it  into structured courses. It uses Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and Large  Language Models \(LLMs\) to turn video lectures into easy-to-read study notes. The  system takes YouTube transcripts, breaks them into smaller parts to fit model  limits, and organizes them into a Domain -> Course -> Module -> Lesson  structure. It also includes a Course-Aware Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\)  chatbot to answer student questions using only the information from the generated  course. )
/E (To solve this, the "CourseCraft AI" system collects free content and organizes it  into structured courses. It uses Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and Large  Language Models \(LLMs\) to turn video lectures into easy-to-read study notes. The  system takes YouTube transcripts, breaks them into smaller parts to fit model  limits, and organizes them into a Domain -> Course -> Module -> Lesson  structure. It also includes a Course-Aware Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\)  chatbot to answer student questions using only the information from the generated  course. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
