/P 116 0 R
/T (A high-performance, responsive web application architecture capable of ingesting YouTube media links to generate architecturally coherent course hierarchies. A sophisticated split-view learning interface that facilitates synchronized playback alongside AI-synthesized Markdown pedagogical documentation. An intelligent, context-grounded RAG chatbot exhibiting minimal hallucination rates by strictly anchoring its generative processes to the embedded curriculum. )
/E (A high-performance, responsive web application architecture capable of ingesting YouTube media links to generate architecturally coherent course hierarchies. A sophisticated split-view learning interface that facilitates synchronized playback alongside AI-synthesized Markdown pedagogical documentation. An intelligent, context-grounded RAG chatbot exhibiting minimal hallucination rates by strictly anchoring its generative processes to the embedded curriculum. )
