284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 116 0 R
/T (leveraging advanced Natural Language Processing and generative AI architectures to mitigate the pervasive challenges associated with unstructured digital education. By facilitating a seamless transition from raw, open-source audiovisual media to structured, architecturally coherent learning environments, the platform substantially diminishes the cognitive load imposed on novice learners. The integration of algorithmic transcript chunking, high-dimensional vector embeddings via the Pinecone Vector Database, and context-grounded Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) ensures that the pedagogical experience remains both personalized and anchored in factual integrity. )
/E (leveraging advanced Natural Language Processing and generative AI architectures to mitigate the pervasive challenges associated with unstructured digital education. By facilitating a seamless transition from raw, open-source audiovisual media to structured, architecturally coherent learning environments, the platform substantially diminishes the cognitive load imposed on novice learners. The integration of algorithmic transcript chunking, high-dimensional vector embeddings via the Pinecone Vector Database, and context-grounded Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) ensures that the pedagogical experience remains both personalized and anchored in factual integrity. )
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [8]
